  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add olive oil and onion, sauté until translucent.",
    "Add garlic, cumin, cinnamon, and clove powder to the skillet, stirring for about 1 minute.",
    "Push vegetables to the side of the pan and pour in diced tomatoes. Let cook for another minute before adding lemon juice and zest. Stir well.",
    "Increase heat to high, bring sauce to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Add broccoli florets to the skillet. Cover with a lid and let it steam cook until tender (about 5-7 minutes).",
    "Season with salt to taste, remove from heat, and serve hot."
